GitHub: https://github.com/FrostSource/droppable_weapons

[h2]Known Issues[/h2]

Weapon physics do not match upgraded parts or all weapon states.

Custom weapons might not have accurate physics shapes. You can use `droppable_weapons_always_use_weapon_model 1` to mitigate this at the cost of having weird hand poses.

